      en: ["The cathedral was built over a period of 169 years, from 1352 to 1521.", "The north tower stands at 123 meters, the highest church spire in Belgium.", "The interior of the cathedral can accommodate approximately 25,000 people.", "It houses four monumental paintings by the Flemish master Peter Paul Rubens.", "The cathedral features seven naves and is supported by 125 columns.", "The tower has been listed as a UNESCO World Heritage site since 1999."],
