      en: ["The abbey was originally founded in 1070 by Benedictine monks from Calabria.", "Orval beer production began in 1931 to fund the reconstruction of the abbey.", "The medieval ruins include sections dating back to the 12th and 13th centuries.", "The rebuilding of the modern abbey took place between 1926 and 1948.", "The trout with a ring in its mouth is the official symbol of the abbey and brewery.", "Orval was the first Trappist beer to be made available for sale throughout Belgium."],
